ct Area** - Visual wireframe showing mining range\n- **Farm Speed Control** - Adjustable speed (20-80 studs/sec)\n\n### ⚔️ MOB FARMING\n- **Auto Kill Mob** - Standalone mob farming with custom priorities\n\n### 👁️ ESP\n- **ESP Ore** - Highlight ores (selective or all)\n- **ESP Player** - See other players (skeleton + name)\n- **ESP Mob** - Highlight selected mobs\n\n### 🛒 AutoSell\n- **Sell Ores** - Sell all or keep limit (custom amount)\n- **Sell Essences** - Auto-sell selected essences\n- **Sell Runes** - Smart selling (1 trait only / all traits)\n- **Smart Inventory** - Auto pauses farming to sell\n\n### 🧪 AutoPotion\n- **Auto Buy & Use** - Buys potions when needed, uses if buff not active\n- **Supported**: LuckPotion1, MinerPotion1\n\n### 🔨 FORGE\n- **Auto Forge** - Skips Melt & Pour minigames\n- **Manual Forge** - One-click forging\n\n### ⚙️ UTILITIES\n- **Auto Reconnect** - Auto-rejoin when kicked\n- **Anti AFK** - Prevents AFK kicks\n- **Auto Teleport** - Auto teleport World1/World2\n- **Quick Teleport** - Instant teleport buttons\n\n## 🎯 KEY HIGHLIGHTS\n\n✅ **Fully Automated** - Set it and forget it  \n✅ **Multi-Tasking** - Run multiple features simultaneously  \n✅ **Smart Detection** - Intelligent item/mob detection  \n✅ **Auto-Save** - All settings persist  \n✅ **Mobile Compatible** - Works on mobile  \n✅ **English UI** - Clean and user-friendly  \n\n## 🚀 WHY THIS IS THE BEST?\n\n- **Most Complete** - Everything in one script\n- **Smart & Efficient** - Advanced automation\n- **User Friendly** - Clean UI, auto-save everything\n- **Regular Updates** - Constantly improved\n\n---\n\n**Discord**:  https://discord.gg/h8QD9JCbCY","tags":["THE FORGE","THE FORGE SCRIPT","THE FORGE OP"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/h8QD9JCbCY","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62b366e3b583da0405348471","username":"v0id64","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/704b1fd66fcece54c34e4202beefa9354fa6091e23f67f7d3472a92d466fd566.webp","original":"https://scriptblox